# Plan: Containerize & Deploy 3 Slice-Specific UPFs in Kubernetes

## Your Current Setup (No Changes Yet)

```
VM: 192.168.49.143 (ens33)
├── Open5GS v2.7.6 (native)
│   ├── AMF, NRF, NSSF, AUSF, UDM, UDR, PCF  (control plane)
│   ├── SMF-eMBB   → 127.0.0.4:8805  (PFCP)
│   ├── SMF-URLLC  → 127.0.0.5:8806  (PFCP)
│   ├── SMF-mMTC   → 127.0.0.6:8807  (PFCP)
│   ├── UPF-eMBB   → 127.0.0.7:8805  / GTP-U 192.168.49.143:2152
│   ├── UPF-URLLC  → 127.0.0.8:8806  / GTP-U 192.168.49.144:2152
│   └── UPF-mMTC   → 127.0.0.9:8807  / GTP-U 192.168.49.146:2152
│
└── Minikube (192.168.58.2, bridge br-7aeac7398ce9)
    ├── Namespace: embb   (test nginx pod running)
    ├── Namespace: urllc  (test app pod running)
    └── Namespace: mmtc   (test app pod running)
```

## Target Architecture

```
UERANSIM  ──GTP-U──→  UPF Pod (K8s, hostNetwork)  ──PFCP──→  SMF (native)
                              │
                           tc shaping
                           (inside pod)
                              │
                         ogstun-xxx TUN
                         (inside pod)
                              │
                         NAT / routing
                         → internet
```

